cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article (preferred-citation) and this software."
title: "Virtual Machine Consolidation in Cloud Computing Using Prophet's Forecasting Tool (reproduction package)"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained Docker reproduction package for WBP (WPSP + Bollinger Bands + Prophet),
  a network-aware proactive virtual-machine consolidation method for cloud data centers, built on
  CloudSim/MetaCloudSim. Includes the simulator, experiment configurations, 100-VM workload
  subsets (PlanetLab, Alibaba 2018, Materna, Microsoft Azure 2019), forecasting code and analysis
  notebooks, plus the AMOVMC and EUQ-VMC (2025) baselines reproduced in the same simulator.
type: software
version: 0.2.2
date-released: 2026-07-04
license: MIT
